      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In the 1830s Greenville boasted a flour mill, wool factory, and a bustling array of craftsmen including blacksmiths, saddlers, and hatters.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
