      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town’s growth hinged on three major roads that converged there, making it a busy stagecoach stop between Staunton, Waynesboro, and Lexington.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9,
